# @name storeKycCniDocument
### Store Sensitive KYC Document - CNI (Carte Nationale d'Identité)
POST {{apiUrl}}/documents
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=ComplianceStoreBoundary
Accept: application/ld+json
# Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}} — disabled for now, no auth implemented yet

--ComplianceStoreBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="documentType"

PASSPORT
--ComplianceStoreBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="ownerId"

usr_123456789
--ComplianceStoreBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="country"

FRA
--ComplianceStoreBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="retentionYears"

5
--ComplianceStoreBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="passport.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ../../passport.png
--ComplianceStoreBoundary--

###

# @name storeKycPassportDocument
### Store Sensitive KYC Document - PASSPORT
POST {{apiUrl}}/documents
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/ld+json
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}

{
  "documentType": "PASSPORT",
  "ownerId": "usr_kyc_987654321",
  "metadata": {
    "country": "FRA",
    "passportNumber": "20AA12345",
    "holderName": "Jean Dupont",
    "expirationDate": "2032-05-15",
    "retentionYears": 5
  }
}

###

# @name storeKycProofOfAddressDocument
### Store Sensitive KYC Document - JUSTIFICATIF_DOMICILE (Proof of Address)
POST {{apiUrl}}/documents
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/ld+json
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}

{
  "documentType": "JUSTIFICATIF_DOMICILE",
  "ownerId": "usr_kyc_987654321",
  "metadata": {
    "country": "FRA",
    "issueDate": "2026-07-01",
    "issuer": "EDF",
    "retentionYears": 5
  }
}
